{"id":534,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"日常の習慣から人間力を育む中高一貫教育","feature_description":"細田学園中学校は、建学の精神「愛と奉仕」を基盤に、人間性・勇気・意志を育てる教育を掲げています。LPPICSでは、健康的な生活習慣、前向きに挑戦する姿勢、感謝と振り返りなど、日常で身につける重点を示します。行事や部活動だけでなく日々の学園生活を通じて、他者を思いやり、決めたことを続ける力を育てる考え方です。日常の習慣を通じて思いやりと継続する姿勢も培います。","clubs":[{"id":14130,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hosodagakuen.jp/juniorhighschool/wdpress2/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/brochure2026.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14131,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hosodagakuen.jp/juniorhighschool/wdpress2/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/brochure2026.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14132,"name":"チアダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hosodagakuen.jp/juniorhighschool/wdpress2/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/brochure2026.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14133,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hosodagakuen.jp/juniorhighschool/wdpress2/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/brochure2026.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14134,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hosodagakuen.jp/juniorhighschool/wdpress2/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/brochure2026.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14135,"name":"陸上部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hosodagakuen.jp/juniorhighschool/wdpress2/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/brochure2026.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14136,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hosodagakuen.jp/juniorhighschool/wdpress2/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/brochure2026.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14137,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://hosodagakuen.jp/juniorhighschool/wdpress2/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/brochure2026.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14138,"name":"合唱部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://hosodagakuen.jp/juniorhighschool/wdpress2/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/brochure2026.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14139,"name":"調理部","category":"文化部","source